Configuration files
===================

/etc/sysconfig/gufo

  Is the global configuration file with defaults

/etc/gufo/MODEL_ID.conf

  Are the models pre-configured. Each of them on a different port to allow
  parallel execution (if enough memory is provided) and to be able to distinguish them.

Install Models
==============

Before starting a model instance it must get downloaded. The pre-configured models
can be downloaded for example with

 # su -s /bin/sh - gufo
 # gufo model import qwen27-q4

Afterwards the engine can get started via

 # systemctl start gufo@qwen27-q4

